        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 1L1R21, Rectangular Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Above Handle 3-5/8 Inch Center to Center</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2 inch by 17-1/2 inch Keyed Modern Multi Point Handleset features an American Style Cylinder Above the Handle and 3-5/8 inch centers. It is made to fit replace existing trim on patio doors. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Modern Multi Point Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material:Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn: 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" Minimum</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-1L1R21-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262402\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 1L1R21 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
